      }
    ],
    "section_id": "s0003",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0001-n0007-l0000",
      "p0001-n0007-l0001",
      "p0001-n0007-l0002",
      "p0001-n0007-l0003",
      "p0001-n0007-l0004",
      "p0001-n0007-l0005",
      "p0001-n0007-l0006"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      1
    ],
    "text": "Data and analytics(D&A) systems, with which corporations utilize to manage data and analytics, are of great signi\ufb01cance in this era of big data. The more mature a D&A system is, the more bene\ufb01t a corporation can obtain from its database, and the more commercial advantages a company can gain. Thus, the maturity of a D&A system re\ufb02ecting to what extent data is managed and taken advantage of, is worthy of attention. Aware of this, we establish a set of assessment and optimization models to assist not only Intercontinental Cargo Moving(ICM) Corporation, but also corporations in various industries with determination and improvement of the maturity level of their D&A systems."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000010",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [
